WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.960
The opening ceremony for the JHS soccer tournament, Holy Road, in Kanto,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.370
will take place in one week, as preparations for it are moving along.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:22.360
In Kanto's A Block, Raimon Jr. High, who won second place in last year's Nationals,

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:29.350
will be up against Mannouzaka Jr. High, Tengawara Jr. High, and Aoba Academy, all aiming for the Nationals championship.

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:34.760
Which two of these teams will take the lead in this tournament and proceed to the Nationals?

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.550
All right, I'll do my best!

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:26.360
I almost had it.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:27.530
Keep going!

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:30.440
We need to improve as much as we can before the Holy Road starts.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:31.990
Okay, let's try it again!

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:32.330
Okay!

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:36.200
Tenma and Shinsuke are really into it.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.300
Reaching for the stars, you could call it.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.110
Shin-sama doesn't look happy.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.320
<i>You have an order from Fifth Sector.</i>

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:53.930
<i>Raimon loses at 2-0 in Holy Road's first district preliminary match.</i>

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.620
So you decided not to resign after all.

00:02:58.620 --> 00:02:59.840
Yes.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:02.870
I just know Raimon will be best off with you in charge.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.320
I know it'll be hard to continue soccer as it is now, but...

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.410
Sangoku-san.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:09.520
What is it?

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:12.840
No, never mind.

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:23.680
Our match-up for the first match in Holy Road has been decided.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:28.100
Raimon is up against Tengawara Jr. High.

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:30.990
Tengawara, huh?

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:34.120
Those guys are well known for playing dirty.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.390
More like they use a lot of rough plays.

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:41.570
They're strong as it is already, so that just makes them ridiculously scary.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:46.460
Tengawara's team uses a very solid defense formation.

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:48.580
Whether it comes to shaking them up from the sides,

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.940
or using long passes to break through the center...

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:54.730
Shindou, your judgment as Captain will be the key to this match.

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:03.340
Coach, weren't you notified of the order from Fifth Sector?

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.010
An order?

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.680
They sent an order for the first match?

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:09.490
What's the score?

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:10.140
Shindou!

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:12.650
What is it? Who wins?

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:16.860
2-0, Tengawara's win.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.230
I can't believe this.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.850
Hey now, we came second to the championship last year.

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:27.410
Wouldn't it be strange to suddenly lose on the first round?

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.980
It's all because we went against their orders for the Eito Academy match.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:33.280
What else could it be?

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.970
This is what we get when you do whatever you please without thinking.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.610
Coach, why didn't you tell us?

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.550
Because there was no need to tell you.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.800
We're going to win this match.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.740
Now this is a surprise.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:54.560
So you're going to ignore Fifth Sector's order, Coach?

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:59.860
Who would ever want a match where you intend to lose from the start?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.420
If you do that, the soccer club will be finished for sure this time!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:08.590
No matter who it is, I won't let them decide the results before the match.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.960
Sangoku-senpai, it's just as Coach says!

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:13.970
Let's play some real soccer!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.000
Don't say that so carelessly!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.370
I want to win as much as anyone else.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:22.460
But soccer these days isn't just something for fun.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.700
Coach, you should understand how it is too.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.240
How we're all putting up with it for our future...

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:31.230
No, I don't get it.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:33.100
I don't even want to try.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:38.920
If that kind of soccer is useful for your future, then it's not even soccer anymore.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.890
I can't agree with you on this.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:47.650
No matter what you say, I'll be following Fifth Sector's orders.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:49.400
I'm with Sangoku.

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:50.840
Me too.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.020
Excuse me.

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:54.080
Wait a moment!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.500
What about practice?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.830
We're losing in the first match anyway.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:05:59.920
Why bother?

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:02.750
Captain!

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.420
You said you'd play real soccer yesterday, didn't you?

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.550
Shindou, you...

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.530
My desire to win hasn't changed.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:20.030
But should we be allowing our personal desires influence the future of our other teammates?

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:29.770
There!

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:36.440
So Tenma and Shinsuke are the only ones left?

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:39.110
Every last one of them are such chickens.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.630
Shin-sama left...

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:44.540
Is Shindou all you care about?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:45.580
Tenma!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.860
Tenma, you okay?

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.470
Tenma?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.800
I wonder what Captain will do.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:58.890
Even if Captain wants to do it, we can't win when the others are like that.

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:10.450
What're you doing out here?

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.030
Sangoku-senpai!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.050
Sorry about earlier.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.300
Don't worry about it.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.250
I overstepped things too.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.210
Running errands?

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.210
I'm in charge of dinner today.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.760
In charge of dinner?

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.930
You cook, Senpai?

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:28.740
Yep.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:32.280
But only on the days when Mom comes back late from work.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:34.850
Cooking, huh?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.300
That's impressive!

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:42.180
Want to come over?

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:53.870
It's good!

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:55.780
It's as good as Aki-nee's cooking!

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.330
Aki-nee?

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:01.330
She's one of my relatives, and she helps me out with a lot.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.490
Now that you mention it, you're living away from your parents, right?

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.330
Must be tough.

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:08.800
I'm fine since I've got Aki-nee.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.710
But I can't just keep relying on her, can I.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:14.360
I need to hold for myself like you do!

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.960
Sure, flatter me some more!

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.550
I'll give you pudding for dessert!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:19.760
Really?

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:21.850
I'm home!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.340
Welcome back, you're early.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:26.340
The meeting ended early.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:27.960
Oh, a friend?

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:29.150
That doesn't happen often.

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:31.010
Hello!

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.780
I'm one of his juniors in the soccer club, Matsukaze Tenma.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.320
Tenma-kun, so you're from the soccer club?

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:38.010
Coming back from practice?

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.050
Yes!

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:42.610
You guys are aiming for the championship this year too, right?

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:43.790
For Holy Road.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.460
Well, u-um, that...

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:48.330
Come eat while it's still hot.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:55.120
My son doesn't talk much about soccer.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:58.350
Maybe because he's reached that difficult stage at his age?

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:03.350
With no father around, there's a lot he won't talk to me about.

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.960
It really has me in a pickle.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:08.510
Tenma-kun, are you like that with your family too?

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:12.610
Thanks for the meal!

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:14.930
I'm stuffed!

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.180
Tenma-kun, what's your position?

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:18.370
Midfielder.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:19.760
Oh!

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:23.830
Does that mean... you make shoots?

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:25.450
Shoots?

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:28.450
I haven't yet.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:29.920
Then what's your specialty?

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.840
Dribbling!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.770
When it comes to dribbling, I won't fall second to anyone!

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:36.550
More like dribbling is all you're good at.

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:37.750
Yes...

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.960
Matsukaze, be sure to practice your passes too.

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.690
Dribbling and passing.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:45.320
Those are the basics of soccer.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.350
If you improve your passing along with your dribbling,

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.480
you'll have plenty to offer for the team.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.640
Okay.

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:53.110
I'll practice hard!

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:58.300
I'll be sure to make an extra lunch box and cheer you both on during Holy Road.

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.660
You don't have to come.

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:04.180
He's been like this ever since he started jr. high.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.200
He tells me to never come watch.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:10.920
Senpai doesn't want his mother to see him losing on purpose.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.510
Oh, I'll go pour some tea.

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.010
Sorry, Matsukaze.

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:22.630
You guys just want to play soccer for what it really is, but...

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:24.250
Don't you feel the same?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.600
I can't be like you.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.510
Sangoku-senpai...

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:36.500
Tenma-kun is just like you when you first started playing soccer.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.280
Soccer was all you ever thought about.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.520
But you looked like you were having a lot of fun.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.480
It's been so long, I've forgotten about all that.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.840
I guess winning must be really tough.

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:54.090
Dribble, dribble, pass!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:56.760
Drat.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.290
Okay, one more time.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.680
Hey, Tenma!

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.390
Shinsuke!

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.780
I knew you'd be here!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.240
I couldn't stay still at home!

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:11.500
It's been my dream to play in the Holy Road!

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.460
I can't believe we get to play in it as first-years!

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:15.460
Yeah.

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:19.320
I thought I wouldn't have to think about the Holy Road for a long time.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.860
So I want to do it with all I've got!

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:24.220
Even if we're supposed to lose in the first game.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.220
We won't lose.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.910
We'll never lose.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:31.890
Yeah.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.310
It's not fun if we play soccer with losing in mind.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.980
Shinsuke, let's practice passing!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:39.830
Okay!

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:44.250
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.780
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.820
The tournament to determine the best of jr. high schools, Holy Road, will finally commence!

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:07.380
The participating teams from the Kanto district are coming in.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:11.010
The Kanto district is well known for its tough competition.

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:14.160
The victor is often revered as a favorite for the Nationals championship!

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.130
Beautiful.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.960
A tidy and well-regulated march.

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:21.870
Beauty lies within order.

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:24.970
Soccer is no longer an activity done with eleven people.

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:33.130
The individual harmonies of all involved form the beautiful artwork that is soccer.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.730
Precisely.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:36.840
However,

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.980
if that harmony is shattered...

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:43.030
Does Coach seriously intend for us to win?

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:45.650
If he does, then something's seriously wrong with him!

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:49.870
My future, my life...

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:52.050
It's over.

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:53.810
It's all over.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:58.420
No matter what the coach says, we'll do what Fifth Sector wants us to do.

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:00.880
That's all there is to it.

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:04.080
They all really plan to lose...

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.640
Shinsuke, let's just do what we can.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:09.900
It'll work out somehow!

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:10.840
Yeah.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:16.050
It's the first match in the Holy Road's district preliminaries!

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:18.050
Raimon Jr. High versus Tengawara Jr. High!

00:13:18.050 --> 00:13:20.720
The path to the championship starts from here!

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:25.210
Raimon, who won second in the Nationals championship last year, is up against the famous Tengawara!

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:28.400
Which team will have the right to proceed down the road to glory?

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:31.120
I, Kakuma Ayumu, will be the commentator today!

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:36.510
Make sure there isn't any misconduct in today's match like the one during Eito.

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:37.820
Of course.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:40.420
I made things very clear with Coach Endou.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:44.670
I'm sure he doesn't want to share the same fate as Kudou-kun.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:50.110
Holy Road isn't just a tournament to determine the number one soccer team in Japan.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:55.640
It's also an election to determine the leader of youth soccer, the Holy Emperor.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:14:00.500
The one whom we support is, of course, our current leader, Ishido Shuuji-sama.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:05.540
For Ishido-sama to safely continue his role as the Holy Emperor,

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:09.800
the matches must proceed according to Fifth Sector's orders.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:11.450
Bow!

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.460
Let's have a good game!

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:17.290
It's too bad you have to lose on the first game.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.960
C'mon now.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.710
Don't tease them, Andou.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:24.770
We get to win against Raimon after they won second in last year's championship.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:26.260
Be happy about it.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:28.030
That's true.

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:30.270
Well, Raimon folks.

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:34.970
Do a good job at losing so that the stands don't get bored.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:36.640
Andou!

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:41.310
I'm sorry for my team's rudeness.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:45.800
It's really unfortunate. I wanted to play a real game with you.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:57.950
It's finally time!

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.040
Here we go.

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:03.460
Kickoff!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.420
Matsukaze marks Hayabusa as he approaches!

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:13.340
But Matsukaze doesn't get a chance with Hayabusa's skillful ball control!

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:20.710
You're trying pretty hard when you know you have to lose.

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:22.810
It's not soccer unless we're trying our best!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:23.840
Huh?

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:25.650
You're a funny fellow.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:27.790
The ball is passed to Kita!

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.860
Soccer's not something you're supposed to work hard at.

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:34.820
Andou!

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:37.880
Tengawara makes multiple passes and closes in on the goal!

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.880
Will they be able to block their attack?

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.340
You're in the way, move.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.770
He passed Amagi!

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:48.400
He's heading in front of Raimon's goal!

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:51.420
I'll take a goal right from the top.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:53.260
Counting on ya, keeper!

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:59.670
First-year Matsukaze makes a good save!

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:00.810
Kurama-senpai!

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.440
I'll take that.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.520
Oh, he missed a trap!

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.530
Tengawara takes the ball!

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:12.270
Tenma!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:13.280
Oh, Matsukaze!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.590
He boldly goes for the ball, but gets injured instead!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.280
Can't you follow the lead a bit more?

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:22.510
We don't want to use up our energy for the first match.

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:25.000
Unlike you guys, we have another after this.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.200
Hayabusa!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:40.850
Amazing!

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:45.770
Raimon doesn't stand a chance against Tengawara's waves of attacks!

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.580
It's no use... no one's moving!

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:52.900
Oh, Raimon's goal is wide open!

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.820
<i>Sangoku-senpai, it's just as Coach says!</i>

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:00.870
<i>Let's play some real soccer!</i>

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.060
Sorry, Matsukaze.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:05.250
I can't do it!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.180
Wow, Shindou!

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.680
He stops Kita's mighty shoot in mid-air!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:26.060
Awesome!

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:28.270
Shindou...

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:30.390
What're you doing?

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:34.570
Wouldn't it be easier if you just let us score one around now?

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.080
I won't let you score.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:36.830
Huh?

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:40.680
I'm not going to obey Fifth Sector's orders.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:42.330
I'm going for a real win!

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:46.370
Shindou...

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:49.920
Hey now. No need for jokes in the middle of the match.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:51.790
I'm serious!

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.190
What?!

00:17:56.810 --> 00:17:59.650
What's Shindou-kun trying to do?!

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:03.250
I hope he's not up to something troublesome again...

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:04.660
Not good.

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:06.100
We can't let this go on!

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.440
Shindou dribbles!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.340
Hayabusa blocks his path!

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:12.060
Have you lost your mind, Shindou?

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:15.070
You don't have a future if you go against Fifth Sector.

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:18.050
I'll make my own future!

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:21.070
Forget your future, this'll be the end of Raimon itself!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:24.270
If we put our all into it, I'm sure we'll find a way!

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:25.830
That's what I believe in now!

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.100
No way...

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:28.710
Kurama!

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:31.130
You'll make way, won't you?

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:34.210
What?!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:36.830
Tenma!

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:41.260
Oh, he covered for Kurama's miss!

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:46.230
Shindou... He knew I wasn't going to make a move from the very start!

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:52.440
Tenma!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.490
What's going on with you, Shindou?

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:59.960
Captain's made a comeback!

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:02.960
As the legendary player, God's Baton!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:09.370
All right!

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:14.250
You're really getting on my nerves!

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:18.210
Hey now, think you can come at me from the front?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.040
Soyokaze Step!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.540
What amazing dribbling!

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.060
Matsukaze zips right through enemy territory!

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:31.730
All right! I won't let you get all the action!

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:34.480
I'm surrounded!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:35.820
Tenma!

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:41.610
What?!

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:43.910
Matsukaze is surrounded by the defense!

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.250
He sends the ball high up in response!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:50.710
Shinsuke!

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.710
Tenma!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:54.870
Nishizono uses a heading to bring it back to Matsukaze!

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:58.300
I'm taking you down!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.680
Captain!

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:10.890
Matsukaze makes a high pass to Shindou!

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.570
But it's a little off!

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:15.460
Will the pass be for naught?

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:17.900
Captain!

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:22.110
What?

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:25.340
Fortissimo!

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:26.870
What?!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.780
Goal!

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:52.920
It's a goal!

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:58.040
Raimon Jr. High's captain, Shindou, makes a goal to take the first point!

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:00.900
He did it again...

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:04.320
Captain!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.950
The first point! Yes!

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:14.310
We did it!

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.340
What's going on here, Tsurugi?

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:55.940
The rippling effect of the first point...

00:22:55.940 --> 00:22:57.830
Nothing will stop us now!

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:00.550
And at last, Captain's Avatar is...!

00:23:00.550 --> 00:23:04.450
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Rebellion For Victory!

00:23:04.450 --> 00:23:06.070
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:17.910
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:25.700
If we put our all into it, I'm sure we'll find a way.

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:26.420
That's all!
